{"author":"Rebar Bot Nava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","data":{"body":"Operator decisions 2026-11-02 (final), superseding the trade-off basis in the earlier decision comment: sign-in and the refs/for/* ACL stay unchanged. Recorded trade-off, verbatim: \"anyone who can sign in through GitHub OAuth can push for review and could read hidden commits by naming their SHA; the operator accepts this risk (2026-11-02).\" Apply path: narrow config-only procedure (git config -f on the live site gerrit.config, in-flight check, restart only the Gerrit container), added to infra/runbooks/gerrit-outbound-mail.md in this change; compose-up.sh is not run."},"env_id":"492a5c71-6cda-48a6-8134-02ff6a672739","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1793644370909913001,"uuid":"8eecac70-b5c2-4ec0-86bf-e6bdd84d57aa"}